Depends: fcitx5, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell
Description: Vietnamese Telex input method engine for Fcitx5
 VietIME is a Vietnamese Telex input method for Fcitx5. Its input engine is
 written in Rust and commits completed text without using client-side preedit,
 avoiding composition underlines in supported applications.
